  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot setup IMAP on iPhone/iPad (iOS devices) with a server that only provides IMAP SSL (port 993).",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "iOS detects the existence of IMAP by using non-SSL IMAP port, which is port 143\\.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Here is the trick that helps you to set it up.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "First, and most important, you have to disable any possible Internet connection.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The easiest way is to switch to airplane mode.&nbsp;",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to **Settings**, tap on **Mail, Contacts, Calendars**↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap on **Add Account**↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap on **Other**↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter basic information and tap **Next**↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It would ask for you incoming and outgoing mail server.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill in the server information.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap **Next**.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It prompts for network connectivity.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap **OK** to ignore it.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap **Next** again.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This time you can **Save**.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**Save** again.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap on the newly created account.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap on **Advanced**.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Enable **Use SSL**.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap **Account** on top left to save changes and back to previous screen.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad",
        "title": "Setup IMAP with SSL-only on iPhone/iPad",
        "url": "/blog/setup-imap-with-ssl-only-on-iphoneipad/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember to switch back to normal mode from airplane mode before testing your email settings.↵",
